          <h2 class="heading-border heading-center mb-4 pb-3 d-inline-block">What we actually do</h2>
          <p class="large-para mb-4">
            Most healthcare AI work falls apart at one of three places: a data flow that quietly sends PHI to a model that shouldn&rsquo;t see it, an audit log the application can edit, or an integration with the EHR that double books patients or drops sync. We build systems where none of those failures are possible by design, not by policy.
          </p>
          <p class="large-para mb-5">
            We focus on a narrow slice of healthcare AI work where we have shipped production systems and where the architectural decisions matter most:
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="row g-4">
        <div class="col-12 col-md-6">
          <div class="workflow-card p-4 p-lg-5 h-100">
